res for it. It gets the\njakarta.persistence.query.timeout hint instead, set from the same deadline.\n\nNot optional: findRelationshipItems is called from the trackedEntities,\nenrollments and events services too, so an unbounded relationship query was\nreachable from three endpoints besides /relationships.\n\nHibernate reports the timeout as a JPA QueryTimeoutException, which is a\nPersistenceException that CrudControllerAdvice maps to 409, so it is\ntranslated to DeadlineExceededException to reach the client as 504.","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"10e749b4b7e56fd784a3022dad12b935c0844bd6","tree_id":"07aa6fe64e712b41bd858e46a580db84133a29b9","timestamp":"2026-08-26T06:23:43Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web AP